    "caption": "Real automation build, distribution business:\n\n**Before:** a staff member spent most of each morning opening supplier invoice PDFs and retyping line items, quantities and rates into a spreadsheet. High volume, entirely mechanical, and error-prone in exactly the way that produces supplier disputes three weeks later.\n\n**After:** invoices land in a watched inbox, get parsed to structured line items, and are written straight through when extraction confidence is high.\n\n**And the important part:** anything below the confidence threshold — a scanned copy, an odd layout, a smudged total — goes to a review queue where one click confirms or corrects it.\n\nWe don't claim zero errors. We claim the errors get *routed to a human* instead of quietly entering your ledger. Accuracy is logged per supplier, and drift raises an alert.\n\nAI automation from ₹15,000. 2–4 weeks.",
