    "hook": "\"Contact us for pricing\" costs you customers you never hear about.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Every agency hides prices for the same stated reason: \"every project is different.\"\n\nEvery project *is* different. The floor isn't.\n\n**What hidden pricing actually does:**\n→ People who can't afford you enquire anyway, and you both waste a call\n→ People who *can* afford you assume you're expensive and never enquire\n→ The same scope can be quoted differently to two clients, and eventually one of them finds out\n\nWe publish all 13 figures with what each includes AND what it deliberately excludes. So the first call is about whether the work is right, not whether you can afford it.\n\nIt also means we *can't* quote you differently from the next person. That constraint is the point.",
