    "title": "What is an admin panel, actually?",
    "hook": "\"Can I update the website myself?\" Here's what that actually requires.",
    "script": "(0–5s) \"Every business asks this. Most get sold a page builder and give up in a month.\"\n(5–13s) \"A page builder makes you a designer. You didn't want to be a designer — you wanted to change a price.\"\n(13–21s) \"A real admin panel is built around *your* nouns. Products. Services. Doctors. Courses. Vehicles. You fill in a form. The design stays correct.\"\n(21–25s) \"Draft, preview, publish. That's it. From ₹15,000.\"",
