    "script": "",
    "caption": "Everyone is selling AI right now. Here's what it honestly does and doesn't do for a normal business.\n\n**It does:**\n✓ Read documents and turn them into structured data\n✓ Draft replies, summaries and descriptions you then edit\n✓ Classify and route things — enquiries, complaints, invoices\n✓ Remove the mechanical copying between systems\n\n**It doesn't:**\n✗ Make decisions you'd trust unsupervised\n✗ Achieve zero errors — anyone claiming that is selling\n✗ Replace understanding your own process\n✗ Fix a broken process. It automates it faster.\n\n**The rule we build to:** measure before you automate. If a task takes 4 minutes and happens 60 times a day, automate it. If it takes 4 minutes and happens twice, leave it alone.\n\nAnd every automation gets a human-review path for low-confidence output, plus a fallback for when the model is unavailable.",
