    "caption": "Here's the arithmetic nobody does before choosing.\n\n**Option A:** ₹4,000 template site. Loads in 6 seconds. No structured data. Rebuilt in 14 months when it's clear it never brought a single enquiry.\nReal cost: ₹4,000 + ₹15,000 rebuild + 14 months of invisibility.\n\n**Option B:** ₹6,000 built properly. Under 2 seconds. Complete technical SEO. Still fine in year four.\n\nThe gap isn't ₹2,000. It's ₹2,000 versus ₹19,000 and a lost year of search presence you cannot get back — because domain authority compounds and a rebuild resets a lot of it.\n\nCheap is only cheap if you never have to do it twice.",
