    "caption": "Next.js. React. TypeScript. Node. Python. PostgreSQL. MongoDB. React Native. Docker.\n\nNothing exotic. Nothing we invented. Nothing that needs a specialist only we can supply.\n\n**Why that matters to you and not to us:**\n\nIf we build your system on something fashionable and obscure, you are locked in — not by a contract, but by the fact that nobody else can maintain it. That's a worse lock-in than a licence, because you can't even see it.\n\nBoring technology means:\n→ You can hire someone who already knows it\n→ There are answers to problems on the open internet\n→ Security patches actually arrive\n→ It'll still be maintained in five years\n\nThe interesting part of your software should be your business logic. Never the framework.",
