    "title": "System 4: does every invoice reconcile?",
    "hook": "Month end shouldn't be an investigation.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "The money system is working if closing the month is boring. Test yours:\n\n❓ Does the total in your billing software match what actually hit the bank?\n❓ Can you list who is over their credit limit — right now, without asking anyone?\n❓ Do part-payments show against the right invoice automatically?\n❓ Is receivables ageing something you *look at*, or something you *compile*?\n❓ Does a credit note reverse GST correctly, or does someone fix it manually?\n\nEvery \"no\" is not a small annoyance. It's an hour a month, forever, plus the risk that a genuine problem hides inside a routine discrepancy.\n\nCredit limits enforced **at the point of sale** rather than reviewed monthly is the single highest-leverage fix on this list. It stops the problem instead of reporting it.",
