    "caption": "If filing takes days, the problem isn't the portal. It's that your invoices were never GST-correct at the moment they were created.\n\n**What \"GST-correct at source\" means:**\n✓ HSN codes mapped once, applied automatically\n✓ Place of supply deciding CGST/SGST vs IGST without anyone thinking about it\n✓ Credit notes that reverse tax correctly, linked to the original invoice\n✓ Part payments and advances handled as the law expects\n✓ GSTR-1 / 3B exports generated, not assembled\n\nThe work moves from month end to build time, once. Then filing is an export.\n\nIncluded in ERP (from ₹15,000), billing platforms (from ₹20,000) and e-commerce (from ₹18,000).",
