    "caption": "WordPress is genuinely fine for a blog and a brochure, and we'll say so.\n\n**Where it stops being fine:**\n→ Six plugins that each want a subscription\n→ An update that breaks the layout on a Sunday\n→ A page builder shipping 900 KB of CSS for a three-column row\n→ A security patch cycle that's now your problem\n\n**What custom gives you:** the panel does exactly the things you do, in your vocabulary, with nothing else to maintain. No plugin to renew, nothing to break at 2am.\n\nIf your needs are genuinely standard, WordPress and a good theme is cheaper and we'll point you at it. If your nouns are unusual, that's when this pays.",
