    "hook": "Static or dynamic? One question decides it.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "**\"How often does something on the site need to change?\"**\n\n**A few times a year** → static, ₹6,000. Paying for an admin panel you'd open twice is paying for nothing.\n\n**Monthly or more** → dynamic, ₹15,000. Prices, stock, offers, new services, team changes, holiday hours.\n\n**Every day** → you're probably describing e-commerce or an app, and that's a different conversation.\n\nMost businesses guess \"a few times a year\" and are wrong — they just stopped changing things because changing them was a hassle.\n\nCount what you *wanted* to change last year, not what you did.",
