    "hook": "\"₹15,000 for an ERP? That can't be real.\"",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Fair. Here's exactly what it is and isn't.\n\n**₹15,000 buys** a single-location system: inventory at the granularity your stock actually has, purchase orders with goods receipt, GST billing with HSN and credit notes, and the standard reports. 4–8 weeks.\n\n**It does not buy** multi-branch with approval hierarchies, ten integrations, or eight years of history migrated. That build is ₹40,000–₹1,50,000, and we say so before you commit — not after.\n\nWe publish the floor because a hidden price wastes both our time. You should know the bracket before the first call, not after the third.",
