    "caption": "Most businesses buy the website, the billing software and the app from three different people. Then spend a year getting them to agree about a customer's name.\n\nBecause they were never one thing. Each holds a third of the truth, and the other two disagree with it.\n\n**They should be one system with three surfaces:**\n🌐 Public website — brings in enquiries\n💻 Billing web app — invoices, payments, GST\n📱 Mobile app — staff in the field, or customers in a pocket\n\nOne data model. One login. One source of truth. Built together so they *cannot* disagree.\n\nHow many systems hold your customer list right now? Count honestly.",
