    "hook": "You need all three when the answer to this is yes.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "**\"Does someone outside the office need to do work in the system?\"**\n\nIf a technician, driver, delivery rider or sales rep needs to record something where they're standing — you need the third surface. A website and billing software alone leave them phoning it in, and someone retyping it.\n\n**All three is right when:**\n✓ You sell or quote, bill, AND have people in the field\n✓ The same customer record is needed in all three places\n✓ You're currently reconciling between two systems by hand\n\n**It's overkill when:**\n✗ Everything happens at one counter\n✗ You bill fewer than a handful of invoices a week\n\nWe'll say which on the first call, even when the honest answer is smaller.",
