    "hook": "He spent every morning retyping supplier invoices.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "High volume. Entirely mechanical. Error-prone in exactly the way that produces supplier disputes three weeks later.\n\nThat's the shape of a task worth automating: **repetitive, rule-based, and happening often enough to add up.**\n\n**The test, before anyone quotes you anything:**\nminutes saved × times per day × cost of the person doing it\n\nFour minutes, sixty times a day, is a job. Four minutes, twice a week, is not — leave it alone.\n\nMultiply honestly before you scope anything. If the payback is longer than about eighteen months, it isn't a project yet.\n\nWhat's the most mechanical hour in your week? 👇",
    "hashtags": "#BusinessAutomation #ProcessAutomation #SoftwareDevelopment #DehradunBusiness #BusinessOwner",
