    "caption": "**AI Automation — from ₹15,000**\n\n✓ We measure the task first — volume × time × error rate. If it doesn't pay back, we say so.\n✓ Document reading: invoices, POs, forms → structured data\n✓ Enquiry classification and routing\n✓ Human review for anything below the confidence threshold\n✓ Accuracy logged per source, with drift alerts\n✓ Every automation has a fallback for when the model is down\n\n**We do not claim zero error rates.** We claim errors get routed to a person instead of quietly entering your ledger. That's a meaningfully different promise, and it's the one you actually want.\n\n2–4 weeks.",
