    "hook": "The morning that used to be retyping. Now it's checking.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Real automation build, distribution business.\n\n**Before:** most of every morning opening supplier invoice PDFs and retyping line items, quantities and rates into a spreadsheet.\n\n**After:** invoices land in a watched inbox, get parsed, and are written straight through when extraction confidence is high. Anything uncertain goes to a review queue where one click confirms or corrects it.\n\n**And the important part:** we didn't remove the person. We removed the retyping. They now check exceptions, which is work a person is actually good at.\n\nAccuracy logged per supplier. Drift alerts instead of silent corruption.",
