    "hook": "Most businesses don't need AI. They need two systems to talk.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Before anyone sells you a model, check whether the problem is simpler than that.\n\n**If the task is:** export from one system, retype into another →\nthat's an **integration**, from ₹8,000. Cheaper, faster, more reliable. No AI needed.\n\n**If the task is:** read an unstructured document — an invoice, a form, a scanned PO — and pull fields out of it →\nthat's genuinely **AI automation**, from ₹15,000.\n\n**If the task is:** decide something a person disagrees about →\nthat's neither. That's a process problem, and software will make it faster, not better.\n\nWe'll tell you which of the three you have, free, on the first call.",
