    "hook": "Still on registers? Don't digitise everything at once. Nobody survives that.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Big-bang digitisation fails because it asks everyone to change everything on a Monday.\n\nStaged digitisation works because each stage earns the trust for the next one.\n\n**The order that works:**\n1. The one process costing you the most hours\n2. Prove it. Let the team feel the difference.\n3. The process that feeds it\n4. Only then the rest\n\n**And the register stays until it's provably redundant.** We don't take it away on day one to force adoption — that's how you get staff keeping a *third* secret system nobody knows about.\n\nAdoption is the real deliverable. Not the software.",
