    "caption": "**Business Digitisation — quoted after a free audit**\n\n✓ Current-state audit of every manual process\n✓ A staged roadmap ordered by **return**, not by convenience\n✓ One process at a time, proven before the next starts\n✓ Staff trained at their own workstation before go-live\n✓ Digitisation of historical records where it's worth doing\n✓ The register stays until it's redundant\n\nThe audit produces a written roadmap you can act on **with or without us.** If you take it to another developer, that's fine — it's still a better plan than starting from a feature list.\n\nThere's no price on this page because the honest number depends entirely on what the audit finds.",
