    "title": "How it works",
    "hook": "We order the roadmap by payback, not by what's easy.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Most digitisation plans start with the easiest thing, because it feels like progress.\n\nOurs starts with the arithmetic.\n\nFor each manual process we write down: **minutes it takes × times per week × who does it.** That produces a cost. Then the build effort. Then a ratio.\n\nThe process at the top of the list is often not the one anyone expected — it's usually something small and constant rather than something big and annual.\n\nDoing the highest-return thing first means the project pays for its next stage. Doing the easiest thing first means you spend the budget proving you can spend the budget.",
