    "hook": "\"Our staff won't use it.\" Usually true. Usually fixable.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "It's the most common objection and it's almost always right — about the *last* system they were given.\n\n**Why systems get abandoned:**\n→ It called their bilty a \"shipment document\"\n→ It needed nine fields where the register needed three\n→ Nobody trained them at their own workstation\n→ It launched on the busiest week of the month\n→ The register was taken away before the software was trusted\n\nNone of those are resistance to change. They're design and rollout failures wearing a costume.\n\nTrain at their desk, in their words, on a quiet week, with the old system still there. Adoption stops being a fight.",
