    "caption": "**1. No software at all**\nRegisters, WhatsApp and a shared Excel file. We start with the ONE process that hurts most and digitise it properly — not everything in one weekend.\n\n**2. Outgrown the tools**\nFive subscriptions that don't talk to each other and a person whose job is copying between them. Usually the cheapest fix we sell, and the fastest to pay back.\n\n**3. Somebody else's abandoned build**\nA vendor who stopped replying, or code nobody can deploy. We audit it honestly and tell you whether it's worth rescuing or replacing.\n\nNobody is too small or too messy. The first call is free and there's nothing to prepare.",
