    "hook": "Search your own business name and city. Right now.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Do it properly — on your phone, not the office computer, logged out if you can.\n\n**Three possible results, three different problems:**\n\n🔴 **Nothing.** No listing. Every \"near me\" search in your area is going to somebody else, every day.\n\n🟡 **A listing, but wrong.** Wrong hours, old number, no photos, wrong category, an address that doesn't match your website. Google treats mismatched details as an unreliable business and quietly ranks you lower.\n\n🟢 **Complete, with reviews and photos.** Good — now the question is whether you appear for *\"[your service] near me\"*, which is a different and much harder search.\n\nMost businesses are yellow. They think they're green.\n\nScreenshot what you got and send it over. I'll tell you which one you are, free.",
