    "caption": "**Google Maps Profile & SEO — from ₹5,000/month**\n\nThe difference is rarely the listing itself.\n\n✓ Profile claim or creation, verification handled end to end\n✓ Primary + secondary category research against who actually ranks\n✓ NAP consistency across major Indian directories\n✓ Keyword-mapped description, services and products\n✓ Photo optimisation and a posting calendar\n✓ Review request system — counter QR, WhatsApp template, post-service SMS\n✓ Review responses written for every review\n✓ LocalBusiness + Service schema on your website\n✓ Monthly report: position, calls, direction requests\n\n**What we will never do:** buy reviews, buy backlinks, or promise a position.\n\nMovement in 30–60 days. Cancel with 30 days' notice.",
