    "caption": "Ask where the phone was standing.\n\nBecause Maps rankings are personalised by distance, one screenshot only proves someone stood in a good spot when they took it.\n\n**The honest measurement is a geo-grid.** We check your rank for the same keyword across a grid of coordinates around your premises. A 7×7 grid gives 49 data points and an actual picture of how far your visibility reaches.\n\nThat's the baseline. Every month we re-scan the same grid and you see what moved — as a number, not a claim.\n\nIt's also how you find out something more useful than a position: **the radius at which you stop existing.** That's the thing worth shrinking.",
