    "hook": "Android + iOS. One codebase. From ₹25,000.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "**Mobile App Development — from ₹25,000**\n\n✓ One React Native codebase → both Play Store and App Store\n✓ Offline-first: capture works with zero signal, syncs when it returns\n✓ Push notifications for assignments and status changes\n✓ Camera, signature, barcode and GPS where the job needs them\n✓ Store submission handled end to end — under YOUR developer accounts\n✓ Signing keys handed to you. We never hold the listing hostage.\n\nBuilt for a three-year-old Android on 4G, not a flagship on office wifi. Bundle size and battery draw are tracked as requirements — an app that heats the phone gets uninstalled.\n\n₹25,000 is one user role, ~8 screens, one store release. Multi-role apps with payments and live tracking land ₹60,000–₹2,50,000, quoted before starting.\n\n4–8 weeks.",
    "hashtags": "#ReactNative #AndroidApp #BusinessSoftware #Uttarakhand #MSME",
