    "hook": "Your own store. No per-order commission. From ₹18,000.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "**E-commerce & Online Store — from ₹18,000**\n\n✓ Catalogue with variants, options, search and offers\n✓ Retail AND wholesale pricing, slabs, minimum quantities, customer-specific rates\n✓ Payment gateway wired idempotently — it cannot double-charge\n✓ Shipping rules, courier integration, tracking updates\n✓ Returns, exchanges, credit notes\n✓ One order inbox across web, marketplace and Instagram\n✓ Inventory synced so nothing oversells\n\n**The honest bit:** for a straightforward retail catalogue, Shopify is often the right answer and we'll say so. Custom earns its keep when you have wholesale slabs, made-to-order items, an ERP to sync with, or a commission bill that's grown past what a build costs.\n\nBring your actual numbers to the first call and we'll compare them properly.\n\n2–4 weeks.",
    "hashtags": "#Ecommerce #OnlineStore #SoftwareDevelopment #IndiaBusiness #Entrepreneur",
    "imagePrompt": "Isometric clay model of a small shop counter with three tiny parcel shapes on a conveyor running into one central bin, one parcel vivid orange, matte materials. low-key studio lighting, deep ink #0E1014 background, one vivid orange #F4501A rim light and nothing else saturated, editorial product photography, shot on 50mm, shallow depth of field, generous empty space in the upper third for a text overlay, photorealistic, 4:5 aspect ratio. no text, no words, no letters, no numbers, no logos, no watermarks, no people looking at camera, no stock-photo handshakes, no clutter, not oversaturated, no HDR, no lens flare.",
