    "hook": "The cheapest project we sell. The one that pays back fastest.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Integrations are the least glamorous thing on our price list and the one we recommend most often.\n\n**Worth doing when:**\n✓ Someone exports from A and types into B, regularly\n✓ Two systems disagree and a person reconciles them\n✓ You've bought a tool you barely use because it doesn't connect\n✓ A customer or order has to be created twice, by hand\n\n**Typical first integrations:**\n→ Website enquiries → CRM\n→ Orders → Tally\n→ Invoice issued → WhatsApp receipt to customer\n→ Payment received → mark invoice paid\n→ Marketplace order → your stock ledger\n\nFrom ₹8,000. Free mapping session before any quote.",
