    "title": "The problem",
    "hook": "You find out what happened last month on the 5th. That's too late to change it.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "By the time the numbers arrive, the month they describe is over. You can't act on it — you can only feel something about it.\n\nThe question that matters isn't \"what were last month's figures\". It's:\n\n**\"What decision would I make differently if I knew this on Tuesday instead of the 5th?\"**\n\nEverything that doesn't answer that doesn't need to be on a dashboard.\n\nMost reporting projects fail by building forty charts nobody opens. We start from the opposite end — the decisions — and work backwards to the four numbers that inform them.\n\nWhat's the one number you wish you had sooner? 👇",
