    "caption": "**Dashboards & Business Reporting — from ₹10,000**\n\n✓ A written metric dictionary — every number defined ONCE\n✓ Owner dashboard: the four numbers that actually drive decisions\n✓ Every figure clickable, drilling down to the underlying records\n✓ Daily or weekly digest delivered on **WhatsApp**\n✓ Threshold alerts — margin floor, stock-out, ageing debt\n✓ Reads your existing systems. No re-entry.\n\n**A dashboard nobody opens is a screensaver.** This one comes to you — the digest arrives at a time you choose, and thresholds alert on their own. The dashboard is for when the alert makes you curious.\n\n1–3 weeks.",
