    "hook": "\"Our data is too messy for a dashboard.\" Usually backwards.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "A dashboard is *how* messy data becomes visible.\n\nWe routinely find duplicate customers, mis-posted entries and stock that never moved in week one. Not because the dashboard broke — because for the first time somebody could see them.\n\n**What we won't do** is quietly clean your historical data as an unbilled side project. If a backfill is needed we scope it separately and you decide whether it's worth it, because sometimes it genuinely isn't — you only need the last two years to be right.\n\nWaiting until the data is clean to build reporting is waiting for a day that arrives *because* of reporting.",
