    "hook": "Power BI or this? Depends on one thing.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "**Buy Power BI or Looker Studio when:**\n✓ Your data already sits in one clean place\n✓ Somebody on the team enjoys building views\n✓ Viewers are few enough that per-seat licensing doesn't bite\n\nWe'll genuinely point you at them. They're excellent tools.\n\n**Build this when:**\n✓ Data lives across four systems that don't talk\n✓ Nobody has the time or inclination to maintain views\n✓ Per-viewer licensing punishes sharing with your branch managers\n✓ You want it delivered to WhatsApp, not opened in a portal\n\nThe common case in Indian SMEs is the second list — and the honest reason isn't tooling, it's that nobody's job is to maintain a BI workspace.",
