    "script": "(0–6s) \"Every agency says 'contact us for pricing' and gives the same reason: every project is different.\"\n(6–13s) \"Every project *is* different. The floor isn't. We know what the smallest honest version of each service costs.\"\n(13–22s) \"Publishing it means people who can't afford us don't waste a call. And people who can, stop assuming we're expensive.\" *[scroll the pricing page]*\n(22–30s) \"It also means we can't quote you differently from the next person. That constraint is the actual point.\"",
