    "caption": "Save this and audit your own profile. Each one is a ranking signal.\n\n☑️ **Primary category** — the single highest-leverage field on the entire profile\n☑️ **Secondary categories** — up to 9, and almost nobody uses them\n☑️ **Business description** — 750 characters, keyword-mapped, not a mission statement\n☑️ **Services / products** listed individually with descriptions and prices\n☑️ **Attributes** — wheelchair access, parking, women-led, payment methods\n☑️ **Hours, including holiday hours** — wrong hours actively suppress a listing\n☑️ **Service area** or a precise pin, depending on your business type\n☑️ **Photos** — exterior, interior, team, products, at work. Named properly.\n☑️ **Q&A seeded** with the questions people actually ask you\n☑️ **Posts** published regularly — offers, updates, events\n☑️ **Reviews with responses** — every single one answered\n☑️ **Website link with UTM tracking**, so you can see what the listing sends you\n\n**Count yours.** Under 8 and you're leaving ranking on the table for free.\n\nFull setup, all 12, ₹2,500. Or do it yourself from this list — genuinely, it's all here.",
