    "caption": "The most common expensive mistake for a new business: opening first, then thinking about Google three months later.\n\n**Why earlier matters:**\n📅 Google weighs how long a profile has existed. Three months of age is three months you'll never get back.\n🔍 People search a new business by name the week they hear about it. If nothing comes up, they assume it's not open yet — or not real.\n📮 Verification takes days to weeks. Start it while you're still doing interiors, not on opening day.\n⭐ Your first customers are your most enthusiastic ones. If there's no listing, that goodwill has nowhere to go.\n\n**New Listing Creation — ₹2,500**\n✓ Profile built from scratch, correctly, first time\n✓ Category research done before submission, not corrected after\n✓ Verification handled end to end\n✓ Your first 10 photos uploaded and named\n✓ Review link + QR code ready for day one\n✓ Q&A seeded before anyone asks\n\nOpening in the next 60 days? Start now. DM \"NEW\" and we'll tell you the right week to submit.",
