    "hook": "40 reviews from two years ago lose to 12 from this month. Here's why.",
    "script": "",
    "caption": "Google weighs **review velocity** — the steady arrival of new reviews — more heavily than a large stale total. A profile with 200 reviews and none in eight months looks like a business that stopped.\n\nWhich means \"ask for reviews\" isn't a task. It has to be a **mechanism** that runs without anybody remembering.\n\n**What actually works:**\n📱 A QR code at the counter that opens your review page directly — one scan, no searching\n💬 A one-tap WhatsApp template your staff send after a job completes\n📩 A post-service SMS with the direct link, sent automatically\n🖨 The review link printed on the invoice\n🗣 Staff trained to ask **at the moment of visible satisfaction** — not at the till, not by email three days later\n\n**And answer every single review.** Every one. Responding is itself a signal, and a well-handled negative review converts better than a wall of five stars — it shows a real business behind the profile.\n\n**What we will never do:** buy reviews for you. Fastest route to a suspended profile, and it's reportable by any competitor.\n\nReview system setup is included in the ₹2,500 profile build.",
